        <body>
            <div xml:id="d290">

                <pb facs="0333" n="249" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg249"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington, D. C.,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1903-11-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November 10, 1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Glass</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Marblehead, Panama:</hi></p>
                <p>Reported that the British steamers at Buenaventura were not detained. Did they
                    leave with Colombian troops aboard?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moody.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
